WEBVTT

01:41.430 --> 01:45.990
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.740 --> 01:48.960
[Episode 7]

01:49.479 --> 01:50.509
Disciples of Mount Wester

01:51.350 --> 01:52.229
must never become demons.

01:53.590 --> 01:54.430
Master!

02:07.920 --> 02:09.080
You can't be without the Spirit Spring.

02:10.080 --> 02:11.680
Since she doesn't believe you can do it,

02:12.360 --> 02:13.680
prove it to her.

02:14.840 --> 02:15.430
Run.

02:15.880 --> 02:17.090
Run first, talk later.

02:27.560 --> 02:28.030
Qingge,

02:28.510 --> 02:29.079
will you really

02:29.079 --> 02:30.150
help my father ascend to the throne?

02:32.079 --> 02:32.520
Yes.

02:34.710 --> 02:35.210
That's wonderful!

02:35.710 --> 02:37.150
No wonder Ranwu urged me to come to Mount Wester quickly.

02:37.520 --> 02:39.120
It turns out there'ssuch a great opportunity.

02:41.280 --> 02:41.910
With your help,

02:42.660 --> 02:43.579
how can we fail in our grand endeavor?

02:46.410 --> 02:47.079
However,

02:48.030 --> 02:49.590
why have you suddenly changed your mind?

02:54.190 --> 02:55.280
Perhaps it's the will of heaven.

02:58.960 --> 02:59.750
Did you see that?

03:00.520 --> 03:02.280
Your Master and that kid Su Yu

03:02.300 --> 03:03.250
get along very well.

03:06.640 --> 03:08.240
So it's all for Su Yu.

03:08.960 --> 03:10.240
Everything is for Su Yu.

03:10.840 --> 03:12.080
I'll go back and tell my father right away.

03:13.240 --> 03:13.870
Qingge,

03:14.490 --> 03:16.190
Su Yishui is your disciple.

03:17.150 --> 03:17.960
Why have you

03:19.280 --> 03:20.570
never considered supporting him?

03:20.870 --> 03:21.430
It's impossible.

03:24.870 --> 03:26.400
Even if anyone else in the universe can,

03:27.680 --> 03:28.520
he cannot.

03:32.630 --> 03:34.190
So that's how you see him in your heart.

03:34.710 --> 03:36.470
But we must not let Su Yishui know this.

03:39.030 --> 03:40.560
He's been too heavily influenced by Prince Ping.

03:41.260 --> 03:42.380
I'm afraid his desires are too strong.

03:42.800 --> 03:43.520
He might hurt you.

03:46.890 --> 03:47.670
Qingge, be careful!

03:49.280 --> 03:49.710
Wu,

03:50.000 --> 03:50.690
take Yu and go!

03:50.800 --> 03:51.310
Qingge...

03:51.400 --> 03:51.910
Go!

04:00.200 --> 04:01.920
No wonder Master refuses to trust me.

04:03.350 --> 04:04.790
It turns out removing the Spirit Spring was a lie,

04:04.880 --> 04:06.260
and helping your Yu was the truth.

04:06.910 --> 04:07.800
I do want to help him,

04:08.910 --> 04:09.800
but there's another reason

04:10.590 --> 04:11.430
for doing this.

04:12.020 --> 04:12.700
What reason?

04:16.070 --> 04:16.800
Fine.

04:17.920 --> 04:19.120
Since you want to help Su Yu,

04:19.950 --> 04:21.600
I'll definitely keep this drop of Spirit Spring.

04:23.800 --> 04:25.510
The more he wants something,

04:25.800 --> 04:26.950
the more I'll hold onto it.

04:29.060 --> 04:30.860
The throne and the universe

04:31.000 --> 04:31.720
are all mine,

04:33.880 --> 04:35.080
no matter the cost

04:36.000 --> 04:37.390
and whether I become good or evil!

04:37.680 --> 04:38.430
As long as I'm here,

04:38.720 --> 04:40.159
you'll never reach that point.

04:41.720 --> 04:42.990
If I can't even manage my disciple's matter,

04:43.190 --> 04:44.310
then I've been a failure as a master.

04:48.920 --> 04:50.159
I've specially prepared an ice chain

04:50.920 --> 04:52.360
and used a drop of my blood to form a prison.

04:53.430 --> 04:54.720
You stay here obediently and wait.

05:08.680 --> 05:10.270
[Jade Peak, Sky Mountain]

05:08.920 --> 05:10.360
Big white cat, big white cat,

05:10.720 --> 05:11.690
today, I must take away

05:11.720 --> 05:13.240
this whole pool of twelve-petaled Ice Lotuses.

05:13.690 --> 05:14.200
I'm sorry.

05:58.630 --> 05:59.830
Without the pool of Ice Lotuses,

05:59.920 --> 06:01.120
the immortal will punish you if they find out.

06:01.360 --> 06:02.560
So you want to come with me now?

06:04.720 --> 06:05.190
Alright.

06:05.600 --> 06:06.360
I'll take you then.

06:06.920 --> 06:08.090
Come back with me to save people.

06:28.310 --> 06:29.160
To deal with me,

06:29.560 --> 06:31.060
you actually broke into an immortal's mansion,

06:31.240 --> 06:32.150
Jade Peak on Sky Mountain.

06:32.270 --> 06:33.270
The Ice Lotus is the world's

06:33.270 --> 06:34.750
purest and most pristine treasure.

06:35.310 --> 06:36.720
It can repair the heart's spiritual power

06:37.190 --> 06:38.390
and vanquish all evil in the universe.

06:48.560 --> 06:50.240
Even if you use up all the Ice Lotus, it's useless.

06:50.870 --> 06:52.190
It's already deeply hidden in my heart,

06:52.360 --> 06:53.240
impossible to remove.

06:53.720 --> 06:54.360
Shui,

06:54.830 --> 06:56.000
stop being so stubborn.

06:59.600 --> 07:00.360
Mu Qingge,

07:01.200 --> 07:02.590
I've asked you several times before

07:03.310 --> 07:04.630
about why you insisted on taking me as your disciple.

07:05.630 --> 07:06.890
And every time you answered

07:06.990 --> 07:08.140
that you just wanted one more disciple.

07:08.630 --> 07:09.680
It was all lies.

07:10.430 --> 07:11.800
You only did it for Su Yu.

07:11.950 --> 07:13.680
I know Su Yu can be extreme at times

07:14.070 --> 07:15.070
and the conflict between you two runs deep.

07:15.700 --> 07:16.330
But I'm not doing this

07:16.360 --> 07:17.480
to help Su Yu,

07:17.680 --> 07:18.750
I want to help you.

07:19.870 --> 07:20.600
Help me?

07:21.160 --> 07:22.240
At this point,

07:23.230 --> 07:24.380
why do you still need to make excuses?

07:26.070 --> 07:26.920
You trained hard for years

07:26.950 --> 07:28.240
to repay a single meal's kindness.

07:28.870 --> 07:29.830
Who was it for?

07:30.630 --> 07:32.000
You defied the Heavenly Sect's order

07:32.240 --> 07:33.430
and interfered in the royal struggle.

07:33.680 --> 07:34.600
Who was that for?

07:35.450 --> 07:36.010
Yet I can't even

07:36.040 --> 07:37.520
beg for a little time.

07:38.240 --> 07:39.480
Everything you've done,

07:39.720 --> 07:40.750
every single thing,

07:40.950 --> 07:41.600
was all just to

07:41.600 --> 07:42.920
pave the way for him to seize the universe, right?

07:43.920 --> 07:45.360
If Prince Zong gains control of the universe,

07:46.310 --> 07:47.430
he will be a wise ruler of his generation.

07:47.830 --> 07:48.830
Why can't I do it?

07:49.240 --> 07:50.870
Because of that drop of Spirit Spring inside you.

07:51.310 --> 07:52.070
It was left by the source of all evil,

07:52.070 --> 07:53.159
the Mortal-Demon Lord.

07:55.630 --> 07:57.000
As long as you have it for even one day,

07:57.480 --> 07:58.390
you can't rule.

08:00.070 --> 08:00.780
Very well.

08:01.870 --> 08:03.000
We're back to talking about the Spirit Spring.

08:03.380 --> 08:04.260
Then tell me.

08:05.120 --> 08:06.480
Do you have some divine foresight

08:06.500 --> 08:07.500
that can see the future?

08:08.630 --> 08:10.120
I have the rare Five Spirit Roots.

08:10.870 --> 08:11.970
Why don't you believe

08:11.990 --> 08:13.080
that I can suppress the Spirit Spring in the future?

08:13.540 --> 08:14.450
Why won't you give me

08:14.480 --> 08:15.190
even half a chance?

08:19.160 --> 08:20.670
You said before that you had your reasons.

08:21.500 --> 08:22.790
What exactly are those reasons

08:23.090 --> 08:23.770
that make you willing

08:23.800 --> 08:24.720
to be so cruel to me?

08:25.800 --> 08:26.860
Mu Qingge, tell me!

08:39.960 --> 08:41.120
I've said all that needs to be said.

08:42.080 --> 08:43.480
I just want to protect this world

08:44.340 --> 08:45.080
and protect you too.

08:48.790 --> 08:49.960
As expected.

08:50.630 --> 08:51.480
Not even half a word

08:51.750 --> 08:52.910
that you utter can be trusted.

08:56.000 --> 08:56.670
Shui,

08:57.480 --> 08:58.290
the Spirit Spring amplifies

08:58.320 --> 08:59.510
all emotions in your heart.

09:00.320 --> 09:01.750
You have too much hatred in your heart.

09:02.220 --> 09:03.300
Don't let it influence you.

09:03.840 --> 09:05.120
Yes, I have too much hatred.

09:07.030 --> 09:08.670
Are you looking for a weakness or flirting–

09:10.420 --> 09:13.920
♫Who is that alone under the tree?♫

09:15.040 --> 09:20.190
♫Stained with a light and clear glow♫

09:20.600 --> 09:25.060
♫Repeatedly awakened from dreams by the shattered shadow of the moon♫

09:25.800 --> 09:31.310
♫Outside the mountain, longing reflected in the limpid eyes♫

09:29.840 --> 09:30.550
What are you looking at?

09:31.030 --> 09:31.510
Let's go.

09:33.130 --> 09:36.810
♫With a gentle nudge of the night breeze, the lantern is empty♫

09:37.150 --> 09:38.240
I have bad luck.

09:37.430 --> 09:42.650
♫Time passed can never be brought back♫

09:39.390 --> 09:40.840
No matter what I feel in my heart,

09:42.000 --> 09:43.510
it all turns into hatred in the end.

09:43.140 --> 09:48.440
♫On sleepless nights, I toast to the world and drown my sorrows♫

09:48.700 --> 09:53.930
♫My lovesickness comprises only of you♫

09:49.120 --> 09:49.720
So be it.

09:54.030 --> 09:55.610
Since everyone has betrayed me,

09:54.200 --> 10:00.010
♫If the long night is too dark, I'll keep you company all the way♫

09:56.240 --> 09:57.550
why should I care about others?

09:58.670 --> 10:00.270
Destiny has chosen me to be Demon's child,

10:00.030 --> 10:05.140
♫To face all the love and hatred, the rights and wrongs♫

10:00.600 --> 10:02.080
so becoming a demon is my path!

10:05.430 --> 10:11.390
♫Our tortuous fate alternating endlessly between partings and reunions, joy and sorrow♫

10:05.440 --> 10:06.200
Su Yishui.

10:06.550 --> 10:07.630
If you willingly open your heart

10:07.650 --> 10:08.480
and merge with the Spirit Spring,

10:08.890 --> 10:09.890
there will be no turning back.

10:10.390 --> 10:11.120
Spirit Spring,

10:11.490 --> 10:16.690
♫Only after experiencing death and rebirth do you realize its preciousness♫

10:11.550 --> 10:12.510
lend me your power!

10:16.710 --> 10:22.450
♫A destiny full of twists and turns, a love fraught with hardship♫

10:22.590 --> 10:27.760
♫But I remain fearless with no regrets♫

10:23.000 --> 10:23.590
Move aside!

10:28.150 --> 10:33.960
♫Waiting for the fallen flowers to dance and silhouettes to pair up♫

10:34.120 --> 10:40.590
♫Eventually nestling in each other's arms again♫

10:39.320 --> 10:40.120
Unless the Spirit Spring is removed,

10:40.830 --> 10:41.920
I will never let you go.

10:46.840 --> 10:48.150
What if you can't do it?

10:48.550 --> 10:49.440
Would you kill me?

10:51.870 --> 10:52.470
Shui,

10:52.180 --> 10:56.090
♫With a gentle nudge of the night breeze, the lantern is empty♫

10:53.310 --> 10:54.520
I don't want our master-disciple relationship

10:55.340 --> 10:56.700
to end up like this.

10:56.480 --> 11:01.440
♫Time passed can never be brought back♫

10:57.610 --> 10:58.330
Mu Qingge,

10:59.630 --> 11:00.670
you said if I killed you,

11:00.690 --> 11:01.730
I could leave Mount Wester.

11:01.680 --> 11:07.230
♫On sleepless nights, I toast to the world and drown my sorrows♫

11:02.630 --> 11:03.610
That sword strike just now

11:04.000 --> 11:04.910
could have killed you

11:04.910 --> 11:06.080
and ended our master-disciple relationship.

11:07.620 --> 11:12.600
♫My lovesickness comprises only of you♫

11:10.000 --> 11:11.020
As you wish.

11:11.790 --> 11:12.840
Once all this turmoil is over,

11:13.360 --> 11:18.980
♫If the long night is too dark, I'll keep you company all the way♫

11:13.480 --> 11:14.630
I will announce to the universe

11:15.270 --> 11:15.910
that Su Yishui

11:16.630 --> 11:17.630
is no longer part of the Wester Sect.

11:19.030 --> 11:24.200
♫But I'm still fearless and without regrets♫

11:24.590 --> 11:30.410
♫Waiting for the fallen flowers to dance and silhouettes to pair up♫

11:26.670 --> 11:27.390
Good.

11:28.080 --> 11:29.000
Very good!

11:30.560 --> 11:37.030
♫Eventually nestling in each other's arms again♫

11:42.320 --> 11:42.910
Master.

11:45.910 --> 11:47.120
It seems the Ice Lotus can only suppress

11:47.510 --> 11:48.670
and not remove the Spirit Spring.

11:49.270 --> 11:50.240
Master, what do you plan to do?

11:52.000 --> 11:52.910
At this point,

11:53.390 --> 11:54.200
we can't wait any longer.

11:56.240 --> 11:57.360
Su Yishui once wanted to steal

11:57.390 --> 11:58.600
the Demon Heart Primordial Absorption Technique

11:58.600 --> 11:59.630
collected by the Eternal Sect.

12:00.150 --> 12:00.790
It must contain a method

12:00.790 --> 12:01.670
to deal with the Spirit Spring.

12:02.680 --> 12:03.680
I'll go to the Eternal Sect now.

12:04.190 --> 12:04.910
Keep an eye on him for me.

12:05.440 --> 12:05.960
Yes.

12:23.740 --> 12:26.030
[Eternal Sect]

12:47.340 --> 12:48.070
Young Master,

12:48.600 --> 12:49.510
I've come to rescue you.

12:50.640 --> 12:51.740
My father couldn't bear to part with me,

12:51.760 --> 12:52.640
his chess piece?

12:53.080 --> 12:54.520
You've said before

12:54.570 --> 12:55.740
that you are not a mere chess piece.

12:56.150 --> 12:58.000
You are the true chess player.

12:58.480 --> 12:59.360
From today onwards,

12:59.840 --> 13:01.600
you are my true master.

13:02.000 --> 13:03.510
The time has come.

13:03.790 --> 13:05.310
You only need to let your guard down

13:05.720 --> 13:07.670
and I can make that drop of Spirit Spring

13:07.840 --> 13:09.840
become one with your body.

13:10.320 --> 13:10.960
From then on,

13:11.390 --> 13:12.870
these little Ice Lotuses

13:13.120 --> 13:14.440
will no longer be able to trap you.

13:15.440 --> 13:17.080
Only by possessing supreme power

13:17.590 --> 13:18.930
can you truly be able to

13:18.960 --> 13:20.600
let down the people of the universe,

13:21.050 --> 13:22.050
while the people

13:22.080 --> 13:23.150
dare not let you down.

13:32.500 --> 13:34.180
[Falling Water Shore, Netherworld]

13:46.910 --> 13:49.360
The Marrow-Cleansing Pool is about to open.

13:49.810 --> 13:51.880
After entering the Marrow-Cleansing Pool, it'll be effortless

13:52.030 --> 13:54.390
to obtain the Spirit Spring.

14:05.480 --> 14:06.390
Mu Qingge,

14:06.640 --> 14:08.290
you previously invaded the Eternal Sect

14:08.320 --> 14:09.320
and abducted Su Yishui.

14:09.340 --> 14:09.910
Today,

14:10.050 --> 14:11.940
you've come again to steal our demonic magic texts.

14:12.630 --> 14:14.240
You truly don't take

14:14.270 --> 14:15.390
the Eternal Sect seriously.

14:15.720 --> 14:16.670
Old Kaiyuan,

14:16.870 --> 14:18.000
don't work so hard.

14:18.390 --> 14:20.000
The demonic magic text is just sitting there anyway.

14:20.200 --> 14:21.600
Why don't you let me take a look? What's the big deal?

14:21.870 --> 14:22.540
Get into formation!

14:30.750 --> 14:32.920
[Marrow-Cleansing Pool, Heavenly Meridian Mountain]

15:08.510 --> 15:09.120
Nascent Soul.

15:10.150 --> 15:10.840
Not just that.

15:14.480 --> 15:15.120
Young Master.

15:16.600 --> 15:18.030
I'm only a hair's breadth away from the Transcendence Realm.

15:18.700 --> 15:20.390
Young Master, you truly are a prodigy.

15:20.990 --> 15:22.750
There's something I need to inform you about.

15:23.480 --> 15:24.270
Just yesterday,

15:24.550 --> 15:25.790
His Majesty passed away.

15:26.670 --> 15:27.360
Prince Zong

15:27.390 --> 15:29.220
is now in the heat of battle with Prince Ping.

15:30.000 --> 15:30.750
Everything is perfect.

15:31.480 --> 15:31.960
Let's go.

15:32.790 --> 15:34.510
We'll go to the Eternal Sect to take the Demon Heart Primordial Absorption Technique.

15:34.910 --> 15:35.510
Wait.

15:36.910 --> 15:38.550
Mu Qingge has already gone to the Eternal Sect.

15:39.240 --> 15:40.240
I'm afraid The Demon Heart Primordial Absorption Technique

15:40.270 --> 15:41.190
might already be

15:41.360 --> 15:42.600
in her possession.

15:43.750 --> 15:45.200
However, with your cultivation level,

15:45.560 --> 15:47.160
there's no need for such drastic measures.

16:02.320 --> 16:04.670
I only need to offer two parts of my divine essence

16:05.080 --> 16:07.270
to counter the effects of the Demon Heart Primordial Absorption Technique.

16:08.080 --> 16:08.910
Young Master, you just need to

16:08.930 --> 16:10.330
turn this key into a bridge.

16:10.840 --> 16:11.320
This way,

16:11.340 --> 16:12.770
you can summon the Spirit Spring

16:13.320 --> 16:14.960
and become one with it.

16:18.150 --> 16:19.320
Who are you really?

16:20.390 --> 16:22.320
I am, of course, someone who has your best interests at heart.

16:23.440 --> 16:24.790
Summon the Spirit Spring,

16:24.820 --> 16:26.300
merge it into your body,

16:26.890 --> 16:28.890
and you'll be able to reign over the universe.

16:29.580 --> 16:30.660
Then who I am

16:31.200 --> 16:32.960
will no longer be important.

17:41.440 --> 17:42.080
Sovereign Immortal,

17:42.110 --> 17:43.070
there's a problem. The Demon Detector—

17:43.070 --> 17:43.790
The Spirit Spring?

17:44.480 --> 17:45.680
The Spirit Spring has manifested!

17:46.590 --> 17:47.510
Su Yishui,

17:48.400 --> 17:49.690
you've fallen to the dark side after all.

17:50.200 --> 17:51.110
The reappearance of

17:51.330 --> 17:52.850
the Spirit Spring is the Heavenly Sect's top priority.

17:53.400 --> 17:54.070
Mu Qingge,

17:54.630 --> 17:55.430
regarding today's events,

17:55.680 --> 17:56.270
the Eternal Sect

17:56.290 --> 17:57.620
will settle accounts with you another day.

17:58.440 --> 17:59.590
Disciples of the Eternal Sect, heed my command!

18:00.290 --> 18:01.330
Quickly follow me

18:01.350 --> 18:02.420
to eliminate the Demon's child!

18:02.480 --> 18:03.160
Yes!

18:03.510 --> 18:04.480
Old Kaiyuan,

18:05.310 --> 18:06.720
where are you going to eliminate me?

18:07.160 --> 18:08.790
Isn't the Demon's child right in front of you?

18:11.640 --> 18:12.590
What?

18:13.590 --> 18:15.110
You are the Demon's child?

18:15.360 --> 18:16.030
That's right.

18:16.720 --> 18:18.000
I've been working on summoning

18:18.030 --> 18:19.240
the Spirit Spring

18:19.550 --> 18:20.960
and now, I've finally succeeded.

18:21.480 --> 18:23.240
After I take the demonic magic text,

18:23.440 --> 18:24.790
I'll come to rule over the universe.

18:25.240 --> 18:26.000
I thought

18:26.030 --> 18:27.350
you were just unrestrained in your actions.

18:27.830 --> 18:28.590
I never expected

18:28.880 --> 18:30.070
that you would be the Demon's child.

18:31.070 --> 18:32.510
The Immortal Realm has long decreed

18:32.720 --> 18:33.750
that the Spirit Spring Demon's child

18:33.770 --> 18:34.810
is an evil that will destroy the world.

18:35.270 --> 18:36.320
Even if we die,

18:36.350 --> 18:37.480
we must kill you.

18:42.550 --> 18:43.330
Master Mu,

18:43.600 --> 18:44.790
I've offended you many times before.

18:45.480 --> 18:46.000
I never thought

18:46.030 --> 18:47.000
that we're on the same side.

18:48.380 --> 18:49.860
As long as you're willing to share the Spirit Spring,

18:50.310 --> 18:51.990
the Scarlet Sect will fully support you.

18:52.640 --> 18:53.640
You want to help, right?

18:54.550 --> 18:55.790
Then stay here and help.

18:57.030 --> 18:57.720
Mu Qingge!

18:58.880 --> 18:59.680
This Mu Qingge

18:59.680 --> 19:01.360
actually colluded with the Scarlet Sect.

19:01.640 --> 19:02.660
She truly is the Demon's child.

19:02.750 --> 19:03.980
Let's capture this demonic cultivator first!

19:32.270 --> 19:33.110
What's that?

20:07.080 --> 20:08.690
The d-demonic army is here!

20:08.720 --> 20:09.620
Run!

20:39.270 --> 20:40.350
The battlefield spans a hundred miles.

20:40.590 --> 20:42.130
It's overrun with rampaging beasts from the netherworld.

20:42.390 --> 20:43.700
They're endless!

20:44.100 --> 20:45.580
Did Mu Qingge summon them?

20:45.790 --> 20:47.730
She herself admitted to be the Demon's child.

20:48.000 --> 20:49.200
She called the Spirit Spring into this world.

20:49.790 --> 20:51.550
If these demonic beasts weren't summoned by her,

20:51.640 --> 20:52.750
then who could it be?

20:53.310 --> 20:54.280
If this continues,

20:54.310 --> 20:55.270
the universe will fall into chaos.

20:55.350 --> 20:56.170
The Heavenly Sect

20:56.200 --> 20:57.750
must eliminate the Demon's child, Mu Qingge, as soon as possible.

21:01.310 --> 21:01.950
Master,

21:02.370 --> 21:03.330
why did you take on the title of Demon's child

21:03.350 --> 21:04.280
in place of Su Yishui?

21:05.070 --> 21:06.680
If people knew he was the Demon's child,

21:07.240 --> 21:08.310
they would surely want to use him.

21:09.160 --> 21:10.600
The Spirit Spring would appear

21:10.680 --> 21:11.640
in this world again and again.

21:12.640 --> 21:13.920
Only by erasing his identity

21:14.920 --> 21:15.790
can we make people

21:16.200 --> 21:17.030
give up on this idea.

21:17.640 --> 21:18.310
Besides,

21:19.070 --> 21:20.200
he's my own disciple.

21:20.680 --> 21:21.510
I'll handle this.

21:22.160 --> 21:23.440
This is so unfair to you, Master.

21:24.270 --> 21:24.790
No,

21:25.480 --> 21:26.590
I must tell the truth to everyone.

21:30.510 --> 21:31.960
I've cast the Silencing Curse on you.

21:32.510 --> 21:34.310
You can never speak of the truth

21:34.790 --> 21:36.030
about the Spirit Spring and the Demon's child again in this lifetime.

21:36.680 --> 21:37.510
Leave what happens next

21:38.030 --> 21:38.920
to me.

21:41.570 --> 21:42.200
Master!

21:58.590 --> 21:59.240
Yishui.

21:59.720 --> 22:00.890
You've come at the perfect time.

22:01.210 --> 22:02.410
I will tell you soon

22:02.440 --> 22:03.990
the location of Prince Zong's remaining forces.

22:04.240 --> 22:04.790
On behalf of your father,

22:05.110 --> 22:06.070
wipe them out completely.

22:08.270 --> 22:09.000
Father.

22:09.790 --> 22:10.640
I told you

22:12.160 --> 22:13.750
that after I obtained the Spirit Spring,

22:14.270 --> 22:16.160
I would let you witness my reign over the universe.

22:18.140 --> 22:20.050
Now, I am the Guardian of this universe.

22:25.960 --> 22:26.590
Your Highness.

22:27.720 --> 22:28.880
Go back and rest.

22:54.160 --> 22:54.920
Congratulations, Guardian.

22:55.070 --> 22:55.770
In just three days,

22:56.110 --> 22:57.640
we've already conquered most of the land.

22:58.170 --> 22:58.970
Seizing control of the universe

22:59.290 --> 23:00.160
is within reach.

23:46.440 --> 23:47.270
Mu Qingge.

23:47.960 --> 23:48.790
You are no match

23:49.550 --> 23:50.440
for me now.

23:50.920 --> 23:51.680
I never thought

23:52.680 --> 23:54.080
you would actually summon the demon army.

23:54.350 --> 23:55.030
What's the matter?

23:56.200 --> 23:57.590
Is Su Yu desperate after his defeat?

23:58.130 --> 23:59.410
Did he send you to kill me?

24:00.360 --> 24:01.510
How presumptuous.

24:02.310 --> 24:03.880
I'm here to end all of this.

24:25.440 --> 24:26.030
What is this?

24:26.640 --> 24:28.160
Direct your power to the acupoints Bing Fen,

24:28.310 --> 24:28.880
Xia Bai,

24:29.070 --> 24:30.030
and Yao Yu.

24:31.030 --> 24:31.660
Do it.

24:32.070 --> 24:32.650
Now.

24:42.110 --> 24:43.240
Your power has solidified.

24:43.590 --> 24:45.110
You've passed the final test.

24:45.550 --> 24:46.480
When it's time,

24:46.510 --> 24:47.400
you can form your Golden Core.

24:49.790 --> 24:51.060
Every strand of sword energy you used

24:51.090 --> 24:51.980
to help me form my Golden Core

24:52.440 --> 24:53.640
was actually meant to counter me.

25:11.790 --> 25:13.160
The Demon Heart Primordial Absorption Technique.

25:13.720 --> 25:14.590
I see now.

25:15.070 --> 25:16.750
From the moment you forcibly took me as your disciple at the Eternal Sect,

25:17.270 --> 25:18.720
you had everything planned out.

25:19.270 --> 25:21.310
Not only did you want to help Su Yu seize the universe,

25:21.880 --> 25:23.750
but you've also long been planning to help him take the Spirit Spring.

25:28.240 --> 25:29.200
Say what you will.

25:30.070 --> 25:31.270
I've already taken the Spirit Spring.

25:31.960 --> 25:32.720
Su Yishui,

25:33.550 --> 25:34.920
our master-disciple relationship

25:35.310 --> 25:36.260
ends here.

25:37.000 --> 25:38.400
Take care of yourself from now on.

25:39.640 --> 25:40.550
Mu Qingge,

25:40.720 --> 25:41.960
I will use my whole life to seek revenge.

25:42.390 --> 25:43.680
Su Yu, Prince Ping,

25:43.880 --> 25:45.640
and everyone who plotted against me must die.

25:47.260 --> 25:48.980
All of this was my idea.

25:49.530 --> 25:50.450
Taking your Spirit Spring

25:50.480 --> 25:51.430
and seizing your universe

25:51.640 --> 25:52.680
was all my plan.

25:53.480 --> 25:54.640
It has nothing to do with anyone else.

25:57.720 --> 25:58.880
If hatred serves a purpose...

26:01.070 --> 26:01.960
Su Yishui,

26:02.880 --> 26:03.990
then hate me.

26:04.760 --> 26:09.700
♫Fallen leaves swirling and covering the empty garden♫

26:11.530 --> 26:16.820
♫Clouds and dust rolling in the distant sky♫

26:12.070 --> 26:13.310
You were the one who told me

26:14.640 --> 26:16.510
that there were other paths to choose in this world.

26:17.070 --> 26:17.960
In this world,

26:18.200 --> 26:21.220
♫Generations of dreams fold into one♫

26:18.480 --> 26:19.410
there are interesting places

26:19.440 --> 26:20.310
like this everywhere.

26:21.000 --> 26:22.200
In the future, I will take you

26:21.660 --> 26:24.220
♫Solitary branches hidden in clothing♫

26:22.240 --> 26:23.030
to visit them one by one

26:23.550 --> 26:24.550
and enjoy each location.

26:25.000 --> 26:26.350
Protect this interesting mortal world.

26:25.040 --> 26:31.470
♫Extend fate to call you back; How lucky to meet by chance♫

26:29.880 --> 26:31.550
You said I couldn't see clearly

26:32.060 --> 26:37.400
♫I've shed thousands of tears, but my feelings haven't run dry♫

26:32.880 --> 26:33.880
and wanted to give me a hand.

26:38.930 --> 26:44.290
♫Hatred adds grayness to my hair♫

26:39.490 --> 26:41.450
But in fact, the one who drove me into this desperate situation

26:42.200 --> 26:43.030
was you!

26:45.470 --> 26:48.620
♫Which side does destiny choose?♫

26:48.900 --> 26:52.020
♫Demon or immortal?♫

26:52.420 --> 26:58.080
♫With you by my side, I'm fearless in the face of life's hardships♫

26:59.280 --> 27:02.550
♫If love wants me to die♫

27:03.090 --> 27:06.150
♫I won't give up because of you♫

27:06.180 --> 27:08.090
♫Thousands of steps to cross the sky-high chasm♫

27:08.120 --> 27:12.130
♫Reincarnation and fate can't be denied♫

27:12.160 --> 27:16.240
♫Why does the world have everything but love?♫

27:16.590 --> 27:17.640
You're all the same!

27:16.730 --> 27:19.700
♫Falling forever is like becoming immortal♫

27:18.000 --> 27:19.000
It's just that the person

27:19.000 --> 27:19.830
and excuse changed.

27:20.120 --> 27:21.360
All of you betray me!

27:20.200 --> 27:26.320
♫I insist to be with you day after day♫

27:23.670 --> 27:24.670
Mu Qingge,

27:25.430 --> 27:26.880
I will definitely kill you!

27:26.490 --> 27:30.320
♫The world bears witness as obsession finally finds its bond♫

27:26.920 --> 27:28.030
Is it not enough?

27:28.550 --> 27:29.720
Is all this not enough?

27:29.870 --> 27:30.430
I...

27:30.450 --> 27:33.360
♫We'll be together again when the flowers bloom♫

27:33.690 --> 27:40.370
♫The moment between us is worth 10,000 years♫

27:36.370 --> 27:37.730
This is the most I can do to help you.

27:44.020 --> 27:44.850
Mu Qingge!

27:50.240 --> 27:51.350
The Spirit Spring is indeed powerful.

27:51.960 --> 27:53.310
I've only experienced it for a moment,

27:53.590 --> 27:55.200
yet I'm already irritable and losing control.

27:56.130 --> 27:57.790
I need to eliminate those demon beasts quickly

27:57.890 --> 27:58.850
and seal the Spirit Spring.

27:59.240 --> 27:59.960
Otherwise,

28:00.790 --> 28:01.920
I won't be able to hold on for long either.

28:07.620 --> 28:08.100
Tell me,

28:08.130 --> 28:09.570
how long has it been since Madam Battle arrived?

28:09.960 --> 28:10.880
How did she manage to

28:10.880 --> 28:11.830
defeat Prince Ping's army so thoroughly?

28:12.480 --> 28:13.440
Haven't you heard?

28:13.960 --> 28:15.350
When Madam Battle fights,

28:15.510 --> 28:16.130
she commands

28:16.160 --> 28:17.520
an army of demons from the netherworld.

28:17.550 --> 28:18.640
She seems to be a demon herself.

28:19.400 --> 28:20.160
Who knows?

28:20.350 --> 28:21.070
She might end up

28:21.070 --> 28:22.240
turning us all into monsters.

28:22.480 --> 28:23.000
This... this...

28:26.680 --> 28:27.550
Greetings, lord.

28:28.160 --> 28:29.550
Madam Battle has been leading the charge,

28:29.570 --> 28:30.490
winning victory after victory,

28:30.960 --> 28:31.750
allowing us

28:31.750 --> 28:33.270
to rest and recuperate in the rear.

28:33.880 --> 28:34.400
Gentlemen,

28:35.460 --> 28:36.110
what do you think?

28:37.920 --> 28:38.510
Yes,

28:38.750 --> 28:40.550
we all feel indebted to Madam Battle's kindness.

28:41.240 --> 28:42.240
After days of continuous battles,

28:42.590 --> 28:43.450
I've seen how hard

28:43.480 --> 28:44.400
you've all worked.

28:45.200 --> 28:46.750
When my father ascends the throne,

28:47.190 --> 28:48.540
I will surely marry Madam Battle.

28:50.000 --> 28:51.590
At that time, we will

28:52.240 --> 28:53.590
reward everyone according to their merits.

28:54.680 --> 28:55.480
Thank you, lord.

28:55.710 --> 28:56.710
Thank you, Madam Battle.

29:26.200 --> 29:26.830
Yu,

29:27.240 --> 29:28.450
you've had a long day.

29:29.000 --> 29:30.000
Have a cup of tea first.

29:37.610 --> 29:38.460
Yu,

29:39.680 --> 29:40.270
you...

29:41.960 --> 29:43.350
You often come and go in the prince's mansion.

29:44.160 --> 29:45.680
But there's something you might not know.

29:46.440 --> 29:47.350
Around me,

29:48.160 --> 29:49.440
there are always shadow guards.

29:51.550 --> 29:52.510
Poisoning tea

29:52.510 --> 29:53.760
is such a crude method.

29:53.790 --> 29:55.310
The palace has long disdained to use it.

29:55.790 --> 29:57.000
Yet you still try it on me.

29:58.000 --> 29:59.030
It's truly laughable.

30:00.880 --> 30:02.200
I didn't poison it.

30:02.490 --> 30:03.020
Instead, it's...

30:03.040 --> 30:04.320
It's an aphrodisiac.

30:05.480 --> 30:07.000
Even more disgusting than poison.

30:08.440 --> 30:09.030
Mu Ranwu,

30:10.280 --> 30:11.240
the only reason I allow you by my side

30:11.270 --> 30:12.240
is because of

30:12.830 --> 30:14.310
your sister, Mu Qingge.

30:15.240 --> 30:16.350
What you're doing now

30:16.960 --> 30:18.550
is simply disgracing her.

30:18.960 --> 30:20.110
What grace does she have?

30:20.500 --> 30:21.370
Do I have to be overshadowed by her

30:21.400 --> 30:22.450
and consider her reputation

30:22.480 --> 30:23.790
no matter what I do?

30:24.110 --> 30:24.680
Yu!

30:26.270 --> 30:26.640
I...

30:26.830 --> 30:27.750
I've been practicing too.

30:28.200 --> 30:29.330
I've gained some magical powers as well.

30:29.500 --> 30:30.870
I can protect you just the same.

30:32.160 --> 30:32.970
Why can't you

30:33.000 --> 30:33.920
pay more attention to me?

30:36.350 --> 30:37.030
Compared to her,

30:37.030 --> 30:38.400
you lack far more than just magical power.

30:41.160 --> 30:42.920
You will never measure up to her.

30:49.160 --> 30:50.030
This incident

30:51.030 --> 30:52.270
could have been punishable by death.

30:53.030 --> 30:54.200
But for Mu Qingge's sake,

30:54.220 --> 30:55.220
I'll let you off this time.

30:56.510 --> 30:57.790
Leave the military camp immediately

30:58.720 --> 30:59.720
and never come back.

31:38.070 --> 31:38.830
Su Yishui.

31:41.870 --> 31:43.070
Su Yishui, don't go.

31:43.830 --> 31:44.830
Help me save my sister.

31:46.240 --> 31:47.590
My sister was used by Su Yu.

31:48.560 --> 31:49.910
That's why she summoned the Spirit Spring

31:50.070 --> 31:51.070
and the demons.

31:51.830 --> 31:53.020
You're the only one who can save her now.

31:54.350 --> 31:55.120
This is my sister's

31:55.240 --> 31:56.270
formation derived from

31:56.270 --> 31:57.270
the Demon Heart Primordial Absorption Technique.

31:57.720 --> 31:58.880
It can extract the Spirit Spring.

31:59.540 --> 32:00.570
Among the disciples of Mount Wester,

32:01.400 --> 32:02.720
only you have the cultivation level

32:02.740 --> 32:03.820
to activate this formation.

32:07.270 --> 32:08.200
I found my sister's practice notes

32:08.550 --> 32:10.440
at Mount Wester.

32:13.920 --> 32:14.960
Why are you hiding here?

32:16.030 --> 32:16.750
The Heavenly people

32:16.780 --> 32:17.990
all want to steal this formation diagram

32:18.010 --> 32:18.840
and take away the Spirit Spring.

32:19.350 --> 32:20.220
But I know

32:20.410 --> 32:20.970
that in the end,

32:21.000 --> 32:22.270
they will all punish my sister.

32:23.200 --> 32:24.200
But you won't,

32:25.160 --> 32:25.640
right?

32:27.200 --> 32:27.850
I've seen the way

32:27.880 --> 32:29.200
you look at my sister.

32:31.000 --> 32:32.550
You won't really harm her.

32:33.550 --> 32:34.070
Alright.

32:35.920 --> 32:37.000
I'll use this formation

32:37.240 --> 32:38.880
to extract the Spirit Spring from her body.

32:39.550 --> 32:40.310
Then,

32:42.030 --> 32:43.750
I want her to stay by my side forever.

33:05.670 --> 33:07.230
Why can't I seal the Spirit Spring?

33:17.030 --> 33:17.640
Immortal?

33:18.360 --> 33:20.160
How can there be an immortal in the netherworld?

33:45.740 --> 33:46.470
Qingge!

33:54.270 --> 33:54.960
Wu,

33:56.480 --> 33:57.550
why did you deceive me?

34:00.880 --> 34:01.920
Because I want the Spirit Spring.

34:04.640 --> 34:05.200
No wonder.

34:06.470 --> 34:07.240
I knew Wu

34:07.270 --> 34:08.360
wouldn't have the ability

34:09.070 --> 34:10.400
to set up my Immortal-Binding Formation

34:10.920 --> 34:12.150
so flawlessly.

34:12.440 --> 34:13.110
Immortal-Binding Formation?

34:25.840 --> 34:27.070
Now that I've taken the Spirit Spring,

34:27.360 --> 34:28.190
I won't give it to you.

34:28.380 --> 34:29.969
Even calling the four Heavenly Sects for help

34:30.190 --> 34:31.110
is useless.

34:34.679 --> 34:35.800
The two of us alone

34:36.360 --> 34:37.630
can't subdue my sister.

34:38.480 --> 34:39.110
Wu,

34:40.400 --> 34:41.840
how have I wronged you

34:42.670 --> 34:43.840
that you would call the four Heavenly Sects

34:43.840 --> 34:44.630
to take me down?

34:46.190 --> 34:46.800
Qingge,

34:48.030 --> 34:49.440
I'm doing this for your own good.

34:49.960 --> 34:51.230
Demon's child Mu Qingge,

34:51.670 --> 34:52.710
today, we shall

34:52.920 --> 34:54.230
carry out heaven's will.

34:55.960 --> 34:57.110
Look at the heavenly bell!

35:14.110 --> 35:15.710
You're overdrawing your spiritual power with your lifespan.

35:20.960 --> 35:21.670
Where's the Spirit Spring?

35:22.320 --> 35:23.360
Where's the Spirit Spring on you?

35:23.880 --> 35:24.550
Mu Qingge,

35:24.800 --> 35:25.550
where is the Spirit Spring?

35:29.230 --> 35:29.800
Why...

35:31.030 --> 35:32.030
why is the Golden Core gone too?

35:33.630 --> 35:34.710
No matter where the Spirit Spring is,

35:35.140 --> 35:36.100
if we kill the Demon's child,

35:36.280 --> 35:37.880
the Spirit Spring will have nowhere to attach.

35:38.760 --> 35:39.610
Killing the Demon's child

35:40.180 --> 35:41.090
won't go wrong.

35:49.480 --> 35:50.140
Activate the formation!

35:58.320 --> 35:59.550
It's the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice Formation.

36:04.550 --> 36:05.910
Su Yishui is still inside.

36:17.030 --> 36:18.230
The might of heaven is awe-inspiring.

36:18.480 --> 36:19.630
Empyrean Bone Sacrifice!

36:46.440 --> 36:47.800
The Immortal Realm passed down this formation

36:48.110 --> 36:49.800
so that when evil demons are born,

36:50.150 --> 36:51.280
the Heavenly Sects would have the power

36:51.480 --> 36:52.480
to contend with them.

36:59.920 --> 37:00.720
Dear disciple,

37:02.440 --> 37:04.320
I thought you invited me here

37:04.760 --> 37:06.510
to reminisce about the past.

37:07.280 --> 37:09.150
I never expected you to be so heartless

37:09.560 --> 37:11.040
and conspire with outsiders to harm me.

37:11.360 --> 37:12.190
You demon!

37:13.040 --> 37:14.480
You forcibly took him as your disciple,

37:14.550 --> 37:16.000
crippled him, forced him to practice demonic cultivation,

37:16.020 --> 37:16.990
and treated him as your personal plaything.

37:17.530 --> 37:18.440
Between you two,

37:18.590 --> 37:19.880
there was never any true affection to speak of.

37:21.760 --> 37:22.400
Stop!

37:22.580 --> 37:23.300
I am the real demon.

37:28.300 --> 37:29.220
The Silencing Curse...

37:30.120 --> 37:30.810
She cast it on me

37:30.830 --> 37:31.910
when she pushed me out of the formation earlier.

37:34.710 --> 37:36.510
Trying to kill me with my blood?

37:36.880 --> 37:37.710
Su Yishui.

37:38.020 --> 37:38.980
Do you hate me this much?

37:39.840 --> 37:40.800
Even in death,

37:41.440 --> 37:42.920
I'll make Mount Wester perish with me.

37:44.030 --> 37:45.590
The Wester Sect never forgives traitors.

37:46.070 --> 37:46.920
Su Yishui,

37:47.320 --> 37:48.960
you'll never be able to hold your head up high again!

37:58.070 --> 37:58.760
Yishui...

38:00.110 --> 38:00.800
Your face!

38:01.980 --> 38:03.440
It's the Face-and-Heart Burning Curse.

38:04.370 --> 38:05.370
Mu Qingge cast

38:05.400 --> 38:06.440
the Face-and-Heart Burning Curse on you!

38:16.150 --> 38:17.000
Mu Qingge,

38:17.550 --> 38:19.360
you brought the Spirit Spring to the mortal world,

38:19.790 --> 38:20.790
causing great calamity.

38:21.390 --> 38:22.690
Your crime deserves death.

38:23.020 --> 38:23.620
Today,

38:23.810 --> 38:25.130
we will gather the power of the Heavenly Sects

38:25.440 --> 38:26.670
to eliminate you, you scourge.

38:49.190 --> 38:50.800
You were once my disciple after all.

38:51.280 --> 38:52.540
So let me

38:53.630 --> 38:55.400
repay your debts for you.

39:26.280 --> 39:27.070
No!

39:27.960 --> 39:28.550
Stop!

39:29.190 --> 39:30.400
Quickly, stop the Empyrean Bone Sacrifice formation!

39:38.190 --> 39:38.800
Qingge,

39:39.470 --> 39:40.630
once this formation is activated,

39:40.840 --> 39:41.840
it cannot be reversed.

39:43.110 --> 39:43.960
Your cultivation

39:43.960 --> 39:44.840
can't be retained anyway.

39:46.020 --> 39:47.460
Why don't you give it to me?

39:48.950 --> 39:49.620
Mu Qingge!

39:52.590 --> 39:53.360
Qingge,

39:53.710 --> 39:54.450
don't blame me!

40:05.750 --> 40:06.880
How could this happen?

40:07.360 --> 40:08.630
I don't want your spiritual power anymore!

40:09.920 --> 40:10.600
Qingge!

40:10.630 --> 40:11.440
Help me!

40:11.840 --> 40:12.700
Save me!

40:12.880 --> 40:13.710
Qingge!

40:50.710 --> 40:57.410
♫Who knows the loneliness of mountains and seas?♫

40:57.720 --> 41:04.050
♫The sharp wind cuts at my heart♫

41:04.450 --> 41:08.000
♫Hold a drop of blood♫

41:08.030 --> 41:09.230
The Demon's child has now been brought to justice.

41:08.380 --> 41:12.150
♫Tattered flowers and tears♫

41:09.560 --> 41:11.290
The Spirit Spring must have been

41:11.320 --> 41:12.400
hidden somewhere by her.

41:12.530 --> 41:18.120
♫Reincarnating but to no avail♫

41:12.880 --> 41:13.480
Everyone,

41:13.590 --> 41:14.690
follow me back to the mountain.

41:14.960 --> 41:16.920
Quickly use the Demon Detector to search for it.

41:18.000 --> 41:18.760
Yishui.

41:18.860 --> 41:25.470
♫Devouting one's life despite knowing it can't be♫

41:23.190 --> 41:23.920
Master.

41:25.550 --> 41:26.510
Mu Qingge!

41:25.980 --> 41:32.060
♫Coming to the abyss despite knowing retreat is possible♫

41:28.760 --> 41:29.550
No!

41:32.860 --> 41:36.350
♫Who says the world is full of wrongs?♫

41:36.470 --> 41:40.130
♫I seize the Way and choose heaven♫

41:40.760 --> 41:41.590
I will save you.

41:41.100 --> 41:47.810
♫It won't be a waste of my life to burn until I wither♫

41:42.150 --> 41:43.280
I will definitely save you!

41:43.480 --> 41:44.230
Forget it.

41:45.110 --> 41:46.030
Everything

41:46.230 --> 41:47.800
went smoothly in my life,

41:48.540 --> 41:51.240
♫There's no need to discuss right or wrong♫

41:48.700 --> 41:50.250
except for taking you as my disciple.

41:50.280 --> 41:51.070
It's too late for regrets now.

41:51.450 --> 41:55.100
♫I can sacrifice my life♫

41:52.000 --> 41:52.960
Practice diligently

41:53.400 --> 41:54.800
and complete the task I entrusted to you.

41:55.510 --> 41:58.380
♫All rules can be dismantled♫

41:55.760 --> 41:56.590
Then you and I,

41:57.360 --> 41:58.480
let's never meet again

41:58.630 --> 42:02.170
♫Die in this world♫

41:59.440 --> 42:00.400
for eternity.

42:02.930 --> 42:06.490
♫The masses spread rumors that are hard to swallow♫

42:05.550 --> 42:06.360
Sacrifice blood

42:06.740 --> 42:07.530
and take the soul!

42:07.130 --> 42:09.950
♫I haven't said anything yet, my heart is clear♫

42:10.470 --> 42:16.450
♫I still don't regret it; I'll pay for it all my life♫

42:16.860 --> 42:19.740
♫You know my heart, won't go against my wishes♫

42:19.810 --> 42:23.340
♫Don't speak of redressing injustices♫

42:23.790 --> 42:26.110
♫Don't let others pity me♫

42:26.130 --> 42:30.590
♫Try your best to forget me♫

42:31.180 --> 42:34.590
♫I'll go through hardships and never break down♫

42:35.170 --> 42:38.340
♫I vow to fight against darkness♫

42:38.630 --> 42:45.050
♫Love punishes me a thousand times, yet a merciful heart pardons me♫

42:45.370 --> 42:48.570
♫No pain, no resentment♫

42:59.500 --> 43:06.240
♫Devoting one's life despite knowing it can't be♫

43:06.540 --> 43:12.760
♫Coming to the abyss despite knowing retreat is possible♫

43:13.580 --> 43:16.570
♫Who says the world is full of wrongs?♫

43:17.190 --> 43:17.920
Why?

43:17.260 --> 43:20.320
♫I seize the Way and choose heaven♫

43:19.430 --> 43:21.160
Why do you always make decisions on your own?

43:21.360 --> 43:27.570
♫It won't be a waste of my life to burn until I wither♫

43:23.000 --> 43:23.800
You don't trust me,

43:24.280 --> 43:25.760
so why did you take the blame for me?

43:27.600 --> 43:28.960
Just because you're my Master,

43:29.510 --> 43:30.670
you think you can say nothing

43:30.670 --> 43:31.550
and die in my place?
